"""Duty Board v3.153.0 — POS 1 REWRITE (voice correction pass 1 of 8
for the ZhiftPOS track).

Style contract v2: plain sentences, neutral trainee address,
ZhiftPOS screens and fields by their real names, numbered
procedures, short reasons after the mechanics. Replaces POS 1's
lessons AND question bank in place.

Deploy: apply -> commit -> then on the server:
  bench --site xlevel.clouderp.one execute duty_board.academy_seed_pos_pro.refresh_lessons --kwargs "{'only': 'counter_system'}"
  bench --site xlevel.clouderp.one execute duty_board.academy_seed_pos_pro.refresh_questions --kwargs "{'only': 'counter_system'}"

Anchored, idempotent. Requires v3.152.0.
Run from ~/frappe-bench/apps/duty_board.
"""

